NO EVALUATION CONTENT IS PUBLISHED

The contamination gate stores benchmark items as truncated hashes only, never as
text (see src/dataframework/shingles.py, and the invariant test that fails if any
item text reaches the published bundle). Nothing in this repository reproduces
the content of any evaluation set.

WHAT IS MEASURED AND WHAT IS NOT

Most figures on these pages are estimates or values read from other people's
published work, and each carries its provenance in the data. A small number are
measured. Several load-bearing quantities — the size of the deduplicated Indic
web, and per-language tokenizer fertility — have not been measured by anyone,
including here, and the pages say so where those numbers would otherwise appear.
The confidence ledger on the atlas page lists what would fall over first.
